[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12541.349, "timestamp": "03:29:01", "text": "这个网站有皮肤之类的东西吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12543.11, "timestamp": "03:29:03", "text": "游戏？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12548.07, "timestamp": "03:29:08", "text": "是的，我有。哇，真不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12550.07, "timestamp": "03:29:10", "text": "是的，它挺便宜的，所以，是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12559.59, "timestamp": "03:29:19", "text": "呃，等等，你玩什么类型的游戏？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12561.75, "timestamp": "03:29:21", "text": "你喜欢吗？第一人称射击游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12565.67, "timestamp": "03:29:25", "text": "或者像在 Roblox 上那样？不，就像一般情况一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12569.91, "timestamp": "03:29:29", "text": "或者说整体而言？不。呃，我玩得像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12578.63, "timestamp": "03:29:38", "text": "是的。你喜欢的节奏游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12582.95, "timestamp": "03:29:42", "text": "圆圈之类的东西。我很喜欢。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12591.83, "timestamp": "03:29:51", "text": "男人。俄亥俄州立大学不错。我买了这张图"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12595.67, "timestamp": "03:29:55", "text": "平板电脑只是用来玩游戏的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12597.99, "timestamp": "03:29:57", "text": "也只是为了玩玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12599.75, "timestamp": "03:29:59", "text": "你可以像使用绘图板一样使用它。"}]